@page
@model AccessDeniedModel
@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Access Denied (ASP.NET Core Identity)

DEVELOPER OWNER: Ahmad
MODULE: Authentication
TRELLO TASK: User Login & Role Redirect (shared error pages:
  ALL TEAM — Final Bug Fixing & Demo Preparation)
TRELLO URL: https://trello.com/c/WoTewqHd

PURPOSE:
Shown by the Identity cookie handler when a signed-in user
opens a page their role does not allow (HTTP 403).

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Any signed-in user.

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Optionally log the denied attempt in AuditLogs (path only).

DEPENDENCIES:
[Authorize(Roles = ...)] on every workspace controller.

STATUS:
EXISTING IDENTITY PAGE, restyled.
